# ── Cinematic media assets ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore every .webm by default so a multi-MB source download can never
# slip into a release, then explicitly re-include the two optimized VP8
# clips that v0.2.14 actually ships (~384 KB total).
# NOTE: the re-include MUST come last — gitignore is last-match-wins.
*.webm
!public/assets/hero-bg.webm
!public/assets/startup.webm

# ── Local scratch output (never committed) ─────────────────────────────
*.log
home-*.png
hero-fallback.png
splash-*.png
MVO_Hub_*.pdf
